\f2\b0\fs28 \cf0 The Grid Analysis and Display System ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cola.gmu.edu/grads/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 GrADS}}) is an interactive desktop tool that is used for easy access, manipulation, and visualization of earth science data. \
The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://opengrads.org"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 OpenGrADS}} Project seeks to develop advanced interfaces and extensions based on the main {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cola.gmu.edu/grads/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 GrADS}} engine. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://opengrads.org"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 OpenGrADS}} Extensions contain a number of additional commands, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cola.gmu.edu/grads/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 GrADS}} expression and script language functions that enhances your {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cola.gmu.edu/grads/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 GrADS}} experience. \
You will be guided through the steps necessary to install this software. 
